{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_1_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you know what is better than robbing banks? Robbing banks with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite up to 3 friends to join you in your criminal endeavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_2_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robbing the same bank over and over again gets boring at some point. That's why many features like position of cameras, guards and objectives will be randomized for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This means every heist will feel a little different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_3_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes not everything goes to plan - if you (or one of your accomplices) triggers the alarm you have to bail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the cops arrive it's over. No shooting your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_4_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No real guard would patrol the whole night between point A and point B and point C...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards will get hungry, thristy or go to the toilet. And you can use that to your advantage!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Small Thug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/545f4443175fbef91d6e1e628d2f4f3e6643d27b.jpg"},{"name":"Professional criminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/2ea956b15a2b9d226e4290bc19d891d17ba3475c.jpg"},{"name":"Criminal Mastermind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/03c7062f3f8ab6d1b2930cc232c0f1f8c5374bbc.jpg"},{"name":"So it begins...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/3cfe0c07dcc1bfc170c923c26690e0f588ff43ef.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/ee2c045ef4b431e0b85a239cb4475702eb2b3a18.jpg"},{"name":"Lockpick Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/e6acdb735ebfc2e72b3ccd7cc6cc54327db55d69.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Hacker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/357b07c3556075b63855d3f07b95ce57d5fa303b.jpg"},{"name":"Root Admin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/aca48c62fb011dfd45270cd4ebd2434ba2504d66.jpg"},{"name":"True Hackerman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/711aa83036ba62e269b0918ea0ecd0fc4029944c.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3382820/414939cf4d21beb0626e1febeab44d5d0039689f.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382820?t=1744787764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744787764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/ac220146c14e47f5411a2fcae61d70baa9125bf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744787764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/ac220146c14e47f5411a2fcae61d70baa9125bf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744787764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_1_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you know what is better than robbing banks? Robbing banks with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite up to 3 friends to join you in your criminal endeavor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_2_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robbing the same bank over and over again gets boring at some point. That's why many features like position of cameras, guards and objectives will be randomized for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This means every heist will feel a little different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_3_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes not everything goes to plan - if you (or one of your accomplices) triggers the alarm you have to bail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the cops arrive it's over. No shooting your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/extras/header_4_en.png?t=1744787764\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No real guard would patrol the whole night between point A and point B and point C...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards will get hungry, thristy or go to the toilet. And you can use that to your advantage!</p>","developers":["Agon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382820/header.jpg?t=1744787764","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118074,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118074/movie480.mp4?t=1742976846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118074/movie_max.mp4?t=1742976846"},"name":"Release Date","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118074/0e1bb5270825d868111701f69d04e73f89f818b8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742976846","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118074/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742976846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118074/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742976846"}}],"name":"Stealth Strike","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Stealth Strike - $7.99 USD","packageid":1196996,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Buy Stealth Strike"}],"packages":[1196996],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"